Dear Sunflower families,

A reminder that tomorrow, Thursday, March 26, is an early dismissal day. All classrooms dismiss at 12:30 so that our teaching staff can complete their pediatric CPR and first-aid recertification in the afternoon.

What this means for pickup:
- The pickup window is 12:15 to 12:30 at the front gate.
- There is no extended day and no late room on Thursday.
- Lunch is served at 11:45 as usual, so please pack a lunch as normal.
- If someone other than a parent is picking up, they must be on your authorized list and bring photo ID.

Friday, March 27 is a regular day.

Looking ahead:
- Spring break is April 6 through April 10; the school is closed that week.
- The spring work-party sign-up sheet is on the bulletin board by the cubbies. We still need two families for the sandbox refill.
- Snack calendar for April goes out Monday.

Thank you for your flexibility, and thank you to the families who covered snack this week.

Warmly,

Marisol Vega
Director, Sunflower Cooperative Preschool
